{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52180","headline":"颂六十二首 五 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄亮吐清气，神响彻幽笼（一作「聋」）。\n登台发春咏，高兴避希（一作「希避」）踪。\n乘虚感灵觉，鱼（一作「渔」）山振思童。\n摹写天歌梵，冀布法音同。\n哀婉（一作「忘高」）故不下，飘（一作「颻」）扬数仞中。\n比丘歌声呗，人畜振心钟。\n斯由畅玄句，即感鴈游空。\n神朝（一作「期」）发筌悟，豁尔自灵通。\n（见同书同卷《呗赞部》。\n注一作者，爲《法苑珠林》卷五十《呗赞篇·音乐部》之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}